          "Switches now use a lighter design with a 28×16 track, a soft accent fill, a shadowless knob, and a state label in the header.",
          "The interface now follows a unified type scale, with 20px settings titles, 15px dialog titles, fewer bold labels, and a 12px minimum text size.",
          "Icon buttons now come with presets, every icon has a hover motion, selected states are softer, and three new icons have been added.",
          "Settings category icons and App Store icons have been redrawn on a single 24px grid."
